<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">perception</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">perception</ansi> stat measures your overall awareness
and attention to detail.

<ansi fg="yellow">Effects: </ansi>

Higher Perception helps you notice hidden things, spot
approaching danger sooner, and react to threats more
effectively. It also expands how far you can see on
your map and enhances your ability to search and track.

Perception improves through use -- the more you stay
alert and rely on keen observation, the more it grows.

